#: backtrace.cpp:85
#, kde-format
msgid "Could not generate a backtrace as the debugger '%1' was not found."
msgstr "Nie mòże wëgenerowac szlachù: felënk debùggera '%1'."

#: debugger.cpp:71
msgid "C&opy"
msgstr "&Kòpiëjë"

#: debugger.cpp:83
#, c-format
msgid "Application: %progname (%execname), signal %signame"
msgstr "Aplikacëjô: %progname (%execname), sygnał %signame"

#: debugger.cpp:96
msgctxt "debugging finished"
msgid "Backtrace loaded."
msgstr "Szlach dzejnotë wladowóny."

#: debugger.cpp:121
#, kde-format
msgid "Backtrace saved to <filename>%1</filename>."
msgstr "Szlach òstôł zapisóny do <filename>%1</filename>."

#: debugger.cpp:125
msgid "Cannot create a file to save the backtrace in"
msgstr "Nie mòże ùsôdzëc lopkù do zôpisu szlachù"

#: debugger.cpp:133
msgid "Select Filename"
msgstr "Wëbierzë miono lopkù"

#: debugger.cpp:141
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A file named <filename>%1</filename> already exists. Are you sure you want "
"to overwrite it?"
msgstr "Lopk ò mionie <filename>%1</filename>. ju je. Na gwës gò nôdpisac?"

#: debugger.cpp:143
msgid "Overwrite File?"
msgstr "Nôdpisac lopk?"

#: debugger.cpp:144
msgid "&Overwrite"
msgstr "&Nôdpiszë"

#: debugger.cpp:156
#, kde-format
msgid "Cannot open file <filename>%1</filename> for writing."
msgstr "Nie mòże òtemknąc lopkù <filename>%1</filename>.do zôpisu"

#: debugger.cpp:164 debugger.cpp:169
msgid "Unable to create a valid backtrace."
msgstr "Nie mòże ùsôdzëc pòprôwnegò szlachù dzejnotë."

#: debugger.cpp:165 debugger.cpp:170
msgid ""
"This backtrace appears to be of no use.\n"
"This is probably because your packages are built in a way which prevents "
"creation of proper backtraces, or the stack frame was seriously corrupted in "
"the crash.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Nen szlach dzejnotë wëzdrzi na bezùżëtny.\n"
"Je tak gwës dlôte, że Twòje paczétë òstałë ùsôdzoné na taczi ôrt, bë "
"ùniemòżlëwić ùsôdzanié pòprôwnëch szlachów dzejnotë. Mòże to bëc równak "
"sparłączoné téż z baro pòwôżną awarëją programë, jakô doprowadzëła do "
"ùszkòdzeniô szlachù.\n"
"\n"

#: debugger.cpp:179
msgid "Loading backtrace..."
msgstr "Ladowanié szlachù dzejnotë..."

#: debugger.cpp:202
msgid ""
"The following options are enabled:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Nôslédny òptacëje są wëłączoné:\n"
"\n"

#: debugger.cpp:204
msgid ""
"\n"
"As the usage of these options is not recommended - because they can, in rare "
"cases, be responsible for KDE problems - a backtrace will not be generated.\n"
"You need to turn these options off and reproduce the problem again in order "
"to get a backtrace.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Brëkòwanié tëch òptacëji nie je zalécané - mògą òne w gwësnëch leżnoscah "
"doprowadzëc do jiwrów z KDE - szlach nie òstôł ùsôdzony.\n"
"Proszã wëłączëc te optacëje ë znowa doprowadzëc do awarëji programë, bë "
"ùsôdzëc pòprôwny szlach.\n"

#: debugger.cpp:209
msgid "Backtrace will not be created."
msgstr "Szlach nie òstôł ùsôdzony."

#: debugger.cpp:220
msgid "Loading symbols..."
msgstr "Ladowanié symbòlów..."

#: debugger.cpp:239
msgid "System configuration startup check disabled.\n"
msgstr "Sprôwdzanié kònfigùracëji systemë pò zrëszëniu wëłączoné.\n"

#: drbugreport.cpp:53
msgid "You have to edit the description before the report can be sent."
msgstr "Mùszisz pòdac òpis fele przed wësłaniém rapòrtu."

#: krashconf.cpp:78
msgctxt "unknown application"
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "nieznóny"

#: krashconf.cpp:159
#, kde-format
msgid "<application>%1</application>"
msgstr "<application>%1</application>"

#: krashconf.cpp:164 krashconf.cpp:171
#, kde-format
msgid "<command>%1</command>"
msgstr "<command>%1</command>"

#: krashconf.cpp:177
#, kde-format
msgid "<filename>%1</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>%1</filename>"

#: main.cpp:43
msgid "KDE crash handler gives the user feedback if a program crashed"
msgstr ""
"Obsłużënk kriticznëch felów w KDE zezwôlô na przesłanié ùsôdzcom programë "
"wëdowiédzë ò zmiłkach"

#: main.cpp:59
msgid "The KDE Crash Handler"
msgstr "Obsłużënk kriticznëch felów w KDE"

#: main.cpp:63
msgid "(C) 2000-2003, Hans Petter Bieker"
msgstr "(C) 2000-2003, Hans Petter Bieker"

#: main.cpp:64
msgid "Hans Petter Bieker"
msgstr "Hans Petter Bieker"

#: main.cpp:70
msgid "The signal number that was caught"
msgstr "Numer ùchwëconegò sygnalu"

#: main.cpp:71
msgid "Name of the program"
msgstr "Miono programë"

#: main.cpp:72
msgid "Path to the executable"
msgstr "Stegna do programë"

#: main.cpp:73
msgid "The version of the program"
msgstr "Numer wersëji programë"

#: main.cpp:74
msgid "The bug address to use"
msgstr "Adresa do wësłaniô rapòrtu felë"

#: main.cpp:75
msgid "Translated name of the program"
msgstr "Przedolmaczoné miono programë"

#: main.cpp:76
msgid "The PID of the program"
msgstr "Identifikatora programë (PID)"

#: main.cpp:77
msgid "Startup ID of the program"
msgstr "Sztartowô identifikatora (ID) programë"

#: main.cpp:78
msgid "The program was started by kdeinit"
msgstr "Programa bëła zrëszonô przez kdeinit"

#: main.cpp:79
msgid "Disable arbitrary disk access"
msgstr "Wëłączë direktny przistãp do diskù"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgctxt "NAME OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your names"
msgstr "Mark Kwidzińsczi, Michôł Òstrowsczi"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgctxt "EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your emails"
msgstr "mark@linuxcsb.org, michol@linuxcsb.org"

#: toplevel.cpp:54
msgid "&Bug Report"
msgstr "Rapòrt ò &felë"

#: toplevel.cpp:55
msgid "&Debugger"
msgstr "&Debugger"

#: toplevel.cpp:87
msgid "Show details"
msgstr "Pòkażë detale"

#: toplevel.cpp:92
msgid "Please attach the following information to your bug report:"
msgstr "Proszã dodôj ne jinfòrmacrje do rapòrtu ò feli:"

#: toplevel.cpp:134
msgid "A Fatal Error Occurred"
msgstr "Wëstąpiła pòwôżnô fela"

#: toplevel.cpp:142
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<p style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><b>Application crashed</b></p><p>The "
"program %appname crashed.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><b>Programa przerwónô</b></p><p>Programa %"
"appname òsta przerwónô z felą.</p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:161
msgid ""
"<p>Do you want to generate a backtrace? This will help the developers to "
"figure out what went wrong.</p>\n"
"<p>Unfortunately this will take some time on slow machines.</p><p><b>Note: A "
"backtrace is not a substitute for a proper description of the bug and "
"information on how to reproduce it. It is not possible to fix the bug "
"without a proper description.</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Chcesz wëgenerowac szlach dzejnotë? Pòmòże to ùsôdzcom zrozmiec przëczënã "
"felë.</p>\n"
"<p>Mòże to równak zabrac përznã czasu na wolnëch kòmpùtrach.</p><p><b>Miej "
"bôczënié, że sam szlach dzejnotów nie zastąpi pòprôwnegò òpisu felë ë "
"wëdowiédzë ò nim. Zwëczajno nie dô sã pòprôwic feli bez dobregò òpisënkù.</"
"b></p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:173
msgid "Include Backtrace"
msgstr "Załączë szlach dzejnotë"

#: toplevel.cpp:173
msgid "Generate"
msgstr "Generujë"

#: toplevel.cpp:173
msgid "Do Not Generate"
msgstr "Nie generujë"

#: toplevel.cpp:240
msgid "It was not possible to generate a backtrace."
msgstr "Nie dało sã wëgenerowac szlachù dzejnotë."

#: toplevel.cpp:241
msgid "Backtrace Not Possible"
msgstr "Szlach dzejnotë je nieprzistãpny"
